---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<BaseLayout>
  <section class="about-page">
    <div class="about-content">
    <p class="hero-gallery-title">
      <img src="/img/ABOUTME_GIF.gif" alt="About me" width="626" height="195" />
    </p>
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-image">
          <img src="/img/fotovanmij.jpg" />
        </div>
        <div class="about-copy">
          <h2>Hi! I'm Nora, a 4th year student at ROC Nijmegen!</h2>
          <p>I am passionate about everything in creative and visual. I often occupy myself with sewing and free embroidery, and I also enjoy playing video games.</p>
          <details>
            <summary>About me</summary>
            <p>From a young age I have had a passion for everything creative and visual. In secondary school, I took a course in Design and Innovation which led me to choose to study Media Design at ROC Nijmegen</p>
            <p>I enjoy playing video games, but when I’m away from my laptop, I’m usally found sewing or freehand embroidering with my sewing machine, and..</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Experience</summary>
            <p>I am currently in my 4th year of a Media Design program. Over the years, I have completed two different internships and worked with various other clients</p>
            <p>During my internships, I have gained experience in various areas of media design, including graphic design, web design, and photography. I have also had the opportunity to work on working with various other clients</p>
            <p> For example an antique shop for which I regularly took photographs and even made a video showing the owner herself and various beautiful items in her shop. I also developed/updated a branding for an eco-friendly and nature focusedc buisiness.</p>
            <p> I frequently take on smaller assignments such as designing signs, creating advertisments for social media, for physical display and I take photos!</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Contact</summary>
            <p>Reach out through the email address below.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>